  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>We're The Salty Nest, a small, family-owned business of ocean lovers. We are also parents (to our 3 little ones) &amp; we create products for children that embrace style and minimalism.</span><br><br><span>We're excited to introduce you to our Outdoor Baby Swing! Designed with our own children in mind, our swing isn't just about fun; it's about creating unforgettable moments with your little one while enjoying the fresh air outdoors. With heavy-duty mounting hardware and a secure seatbelt, you can swing your baby to toddler worry-free.</span><br><br><span>We invite you to collaborate with us as a long-term affiliate through your own personalized link. For every sale made, we'll give you a 20% commission, building a relationship that benefits both our small company and the families we work with.</span><br><br><span>We cherish the memories with our children, and we're happy to provide a product that allows other moms and dads to create lasting memories with their children too!</span></p>",
